WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.224
AI systems lists everything found and registered, by where it came from and how far along it is.

2
00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:11.598
The columns run from found, to registered, to approved and watched.

3
00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.760
Search by name, source or kind.

4
